<section class="how">
  <h2>How to Use This Time Duration Calculator</h2>
  <p>The calculator features two distinct operational modes designed for work shift tracking and schedule planning.</p>
  <p><strong>Time Between Mode:</strong> Calculates the exact elapsed time between a start time and end time. Ideal for computing shift lengths, meeting durations, or project billable hours. If the end time is numerically earlier than the start time, the calculator automatically detects an overnight shift and adds 24 hours to the calculation.</p>
  <p><strong>Add or Subtract Mode:</strong> Takes a starting time and applies a specified hour and minute offset. Use this to determine exact task completion times, project deadlines, or clock time adjustments when coordinating across time zones.</p>
</section>

