  <ul>
    <li><strong>Standard Shift with Lunch:</strong> Shift from 08:00 to 17:00 equals 9.0 hours gross. Subtracting a 30-minute unpaid break (0.50 decimal hours) leaves 8.50 net decimal hours. At $22.00 per hour, total gross pay is $187.00.</li>
